MANOSABA_LIN_CARD_ELEVATOR_TRIAL.descrip:
[color=#CC6666]【Endless Fall】[/color]
Deal {Damage:diff()} [color=#CC6666]damage[/color], shuffle this card back into the [color=#CC6666]draw pile[/color] after playing. Each time played this combat, [color=#CC6666]damage[/color] increases by {RecursionDamage:diff()}
[b]Exhaust[/b] 1 random non-[color=#CC6666]Attack[/color] card from your hand

MANOSABA_LIN_CARD_SUBSTITUTE_COST.descri:
[color=#ffcc99][b]「Intimacy」[/b][/color]
[color=ffcc99]This turn[/color], [color=ff99cc]Attack[/color] card damage + [color=ffcc99]Intimacy[/color] stacks. [color=ffcc99]Next turn[/color], lose {energyPrefix:energyIcons(2)}.
If [color=#ffcc99]「Intimacy」[/color] > [color=#ff99cc]「Estrangement」[/color], [color=ff99cc]next turn[/color] gain {IfUpgraded:show:{energyPrefix:energyIcons(2)}|{energyPrefix:energyIcons(1)}}

MANOSABA_LIN_CARD_ANN_ESTRANGEMENT.descr:
[color=#6666cc][b]「Estrangement」[/b][/color]
Apply 2 stacks of [b]Weak[/b] and 2 stacks of [b]Vulnerable[/b] to [color=#6666cc]target[/color].
If [color=#6666cc]「Estrangement」[/color] > [color=#ff99cc]「Intimacy」[/color], deal additional [color=#ff99cc]damage[/color] equal to [color=#ff99cc]Estrangement[/color] value times {DamageMult:diff()}

